+def _requote(requoter: Any, value: str) -> str:
+    """Requote a parsed component, keeping a "%" that starts no octet.
+
+    The WHATWG URL Standard leaves such a "%" as it is: "/foo%2zbar" stays
+    "/foo%2zbar", where encoding it as "%25" would change what the URL
+    means. RFC 3986 mode rejects it before this runs.
